# The committed exception: the actual notebooks for the main analysis
# and the Brodbeck et al. 2020 replication, not jupytext's paired
# byproduct.
!analysis/cortical_analysis.ipynb
!analysis/cortical_analysis_2.ipynb
!analysis/cortical_analysis_3.ipynb
# The per-condition notebooks (settings in analysis/parameters.py).
